---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Me | Salekur Rahaman"
  description="Learn about Salekur Rahaman, a software engineer, systems architect, and product builder based in Rajshahi, Bangladesh."
>
  <section class="py-20 px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Image -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 lg:col-span-4 md:sticky md:top-24">
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass border border-border-dark bg-bg-card/50 aspect-[4/5] relative">
          <img 
            src="/assets/images/salekur.jpg" 
            alt="Salekur Rahaman" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale contrast-110 hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-bg-dark/60 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Quick contact grid under photo -->
        <div class="mt-6 p-4 rounded-xl border border-border-dark/60 bg-bg-card/20 font-mono text-xs tracking-wider text-secondary space-y-2.5">
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <span class="text-muted font-medium">LOCATION:</span>
            <span class="text-primary font-semibold">Rajshahi, Bangladesh</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <span class="text-muted font-medium">ROLE:</span>
            <span class="text-primary font-semibold">Software Engineer</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between">
            <span class="text-muted font-medium">EMAIL:</span>
            <a href="mailto:salekur@lagbe.dev" class="text-accent-teal font-semibold hover:underline">salekur@lagbe.dev</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Narrative -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 lg:col-span-8">
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="border-b border-border-dark/30 pb-5 mb-6">
          <h1 class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-accent-teal uppercase mb-2">INTRODUCING SALEKUR</h1>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-sans font-bold tracking-tight text-gradient leading-tight pb-1">
            Product Architect & AI Engineer
          </h2>
        </div>

        <!-- Narrative Blocks -->
        <div class="space-y-6 text-secondary text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-primary text-base sm:text-lg font-medium font-serif italic">
            "I don't want to only write code. I want to build things that matter."
          </p>
          
          <p>
            I am a software engineer and solutions architect focused on the intersection of scalable backend engineering, mobile app development, and practical AI systems. As the Software Engineer and Product Architect at <a href="https://www.lagbe.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:text-accent-teal underline underline-offset-4 decoration-accent-teal/40 transition-colors">Lagbe Technology</a>, I have spent years architecting systems from initial concept to production release.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            My core strength is <strong class="text-primary font-semibold">systems thinking</strong>—understanding how user experiences map into database schemas, server resource capacities, queue architectures, and network protocols. I don't build features in isolation; I design them to scale seamlessly as cohesive ecosystems.
          </p>

          <p>
            Whether implementing multi-sided marketplace platforms, structuring robust payment splits, deploying vector similarity database searches, or wiring up custom IoT firmware on local networks, I prioritize code cleanliness, minimal dependency usage, and thorough performance optimization.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Interests Section -->
        <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-border-dark/30">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-mono tracking-widest text-accent-teal uppercase mb-6">Core Areas of Focus</h3>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 font-mono text-xs text-secondary">
            
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-border-dark bg-bg-card/10 hover:border-accent-teal/30 transition-colors">
              <h4 class="text-primary font-bold mb-2 uppercase">Software Engineering</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                Designing distributed backends, REST APIs, WebSockets, queue architectures, and writing framework-agnostic developer tools.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-border-dark bg-bg-card/10 hover:border-accent-teal/30 transition-colors">
              <h4 class="text-primary font-bold mb-2 uppercase">Product Building</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                Guiding product lifecycles, understanding merchant and consumer friction points, and structuring SaaS platforms.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-border-dark bg-bg-card/10 hover:border-accent-teal/30 transition-colors">
              <h4 class="text-primary font-bold mb-2 uppercase">Semantic Search & AI</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                Integrating AI vectors (Qdrant), sentence embeddings, and computer vision (OpenCV) filters into standard business workflows.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-border-dark bg-bg-card/10 hover:border-accent-teal/30 transition-colors">
              <h4 class="text-primary font-bold mb-2 uppercase">IoT & Hardware</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                Interfacing microcontroller layers (Raspberry Pi, ESP8266) with local network systems (MQTT, local APIs).
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
